oracle: pinned historical source, CPython v2.2 and v2.7.18 (no host python2; blob IDs in code/grammars/python/pair-evidence.csv)
host-python2: accepts
result: py2-int-print refuses it with a Unsupported error naming the release
why: `print a, b` writes `a b`; refused because CPython 2 flushes a pending softspace as a newline before an uncaught exception (Python/pythonrun.c Py_FlushLine), which needs a trap handler
